@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title actraild observer PID 统一与 fork / exec 身份收敛

participant "actraild\n(observer PID namespace)" as Daemon
participant "eBPF config / maps" as Maps
participant "parent / child" as Workload
participant "seccomp user-notify" as Seccomp
participant "eBPF process hooks" as Hooks
participant "Identity Runtime" as Identity
database "Storage" as Storage

== 启动：确定 observer 坐标 ==
Daemon -> Daemon : stat /proc/self/ns/pid\n取得 pidns dev + ino
Daemon -> Maps : 下发 observer PID namespace
note right of Maps
  eBPF 内部基准：
  map_pid = raw kernel TGID
  generation = start_boottime_ns
end note

== Fork：直接建立双坐标 ==
Workload -> Hooks : sched_process_fork(parent, child)
Hooks -> Maps : fork binding[map_pid]\n= trace_id + generation
Hooks -> Hooks : group_leader → thread_pid → numbers[]\n按 observer inode解析 child observer_pid
Hooks -> Maps : 首次发现并缓存 observer namespace level
Hooks -> Maps : observer index[observer_pid] = map_pid
Hooks -> Daemon : fork(trace_id, observer_pid, map_pid, generation)
Daemon -> Identity : 立即解析唯一 ProcessIdentity
note over Hooks, Maps
  首次发现：bounded O(namespace depth)
  稳态：numbers[cached_level]，O(1)
  每次快路径核验 namespace inode
end note

== Seccomp：按 observer PID完成控制 ==
Workload -> Seccomp : child execve(...)
Seccomp -> Daemon : notification(observer_pid)
Daemon -> Identity : observer pidns + observer_pid\n父 membership
Identity --> Daemon : ProcessIdentity + TraceId
Daemon -> Daemon : command policy decision
Daemon --> Seccomp : allow / deny
note over Daemon, Identity
  command-control 基准是 ProcessIdentity；
  不读取、对账或补全 eBPF fork map。
end note

alt allow：完成 exec
  Seccomp --> Workload : resume
  Workload -> Hooks : sched_process_exec(child current)
  Hooks -> Daemon : exec(trace_id, map_pid, generation)
  Daemon -> Identity : 按 map_pid命中 fork 已建立的身份
  Identity --> Daemon : 同一个 ProcessIdentity
  Daemon -> Storage : 按 fork → exec 顺序持久化
else deny / exec 前退出
  Hooks -> Maps : 退出时清理 raw binding 与 observer index
end

note over Daemon, Storage
  上层唯一身份基准：ProcessIdentity
  上层统一 PID 坐标：actraild observer PID
  raw kernel TGID仅用于 eBPF 内部 map 与 lineage
end note
@enduml
